				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Gp.</u>
					18.14.3
				</span></i>
			: aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕπνωσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Epid.</u>
					3.1
				</span></i>
			.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γ́,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				3.81.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Si.</u>
				46.20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				1.12.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Alex.</u>
				76
			</span></i>, etc.: pf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕπνωκα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.236b
				</span></i>
