				Dsc.
				4.63
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>fall asleep, sleep,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
			</span></i> ll.cc.:—so in 
				Med.
			, J.l.c. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			intr., like
			
