			, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				3.1
			</span></i>.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γ́,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				7.11
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπνώσσουσα</span>
