			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				1.12.1
			</span></i>; 
				Lacon.
			
			inf.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπνῶν,</span> for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-οῦν,</span>
